
### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4005
@eventId = '67650d53c1234567890abcde'
@postId = '67650d53c1234567890abcdf'
@userId = user123
@userName = John Doe
@userRole = volunteer

### 1. Lấy danh sách posts (mới nhất)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts?sortBy=latest&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Lấy danh sách posts (tương tác mới nhất)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts?sortBy=most_active&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Lấy chi tiết 1 post
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Tạo post mới
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}
x-user-name: {{userName}}

{
  "content": "Chào mọi người! Mình rất vui được tham gia sự kiện này. Hẹn gặp các bạn! 🎉",
  "images": ["https://example.com/image1.jpg"]
}

### 5. Sửa post
PUT {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "content": "Nội dung đã được cập nhật",
  "images": []
}

### 6. Xóa post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts/{{postId}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}
x-user-role: {{userRole}}

### 7. Like post
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts/{{postId}}/like
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}
x-user-name: {{userName}}

### 8. Unlike post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts/{{postId}}/like
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### 9. Ghim post (Event Manager / Admin only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts/{{postId}}/pin
x-user-role: event_manager

### 10. Bỏ ghim post (Event Manager / Admin only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts/{{postId}}/unpin
x-user-role: event_manager

### 11. Thêm comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts/{{postId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}
x-user-name: {{userName}}

{
  "content": "Comment rất hay! Mình cũng nghĩ vậy."
}

### 12. Sửa comment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts/{{postId}}/comments/comment123
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "content": "Comment đã được chỉnh sửa"
}

### 13. Xóa comment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts/{{postId}}/comments/comment123
x-user-id: {{userId}}
x-user-role: {{userRole}}

### 14. Test với nhiều posts (pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts?limit=5&skip=0
Content-Type: application/json

### 15. Load more posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}/posts?limit=5&skip=5
Content-Type: application/json